{"4063670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isophoria", "steam_appid": 4063670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cyberpunk narrative RPG</strong> about a prodigal young woman with no skills, no support, and no ambition attempting to make a new life in a chaotic metropolis built for exploitation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rent is due.</strong> Dive into the cavernous ecosystem of a city that shouldn't exist, taking on strange gig jobs from a diverse and quirky cast of clients. <strong>You'll do anything to make it to the next day</strong>—but can you pay the bills before the technology you depend on completely destroys you? </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cyberpunk narrative RPG</strong> about a prodigal young woman with no skills, no support, and no ambition attempting to make a new life in a chaotic metropolis built for exploitation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rent is due.</strong> Dive into the cavernous ecosystem of a city that shouldn't exist, taking on strange gig jobs from a diverse and quirky cast of clients. <strong>You'll do anything to make it to the next day</strong>—but can you pay the bills before the technology you depend on completely destroys you? </p>", "short_description": "A narrative RPG set in a surreal cyberpunk world. Be a good neighbor or a sly opportunist. Play retro mini games to complete niche gigs. Hack your nervous system with dubious technology and navigate the strange side effects. Find your way through somehow, just don't get lost in the back alleys.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063670/66fc0aa46e3e9754929def6eec2033c884752be3/header.jpg?t=1770043904", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps